00:16:38,860 --> 00:16:39,700
Please help!

274
00:16:40,160 --> 00:16:40,680
Anyone!

275
00:16:41,060 --> 00:16:42,100
Asta's in trouble!

276
00:16:42,100 --> 00:16:56,200
Thank you, sir!

277
00:16:56,980 --> 00:16:57,620
Concentrate!

278
00:17:00,200 --> 00:17:00,760
Ow!

279
00:17:01,320 --> 00:17:02,920
What'd you do that for?

280
00:17:03,240 --> 00:17:04,680
Tell me, black bull girl.

281
00:17:04,680 --> 00:17:09,120
You aren't hesitating because of your siblings' taunting, are you?

282
00:17:11,700 --> 00:17:13,980
There's no time for that on the battlefield!

283
00:17:15,540 --> 00:17:18,620
One bad decision out here could mean lives lost.

284
00:17:20,060 --> 00:17:21,540
Forget your insecurities.

285
00:17:22,000 --> 00:17:24,860
You stand here today as a member of the Magic Knights.

286
00:17:24,860 --> 00:17:31,160
If you join the Order of your own Accord, you must be determined to grow stronger!

287
00:17:32,080 --> 00:17:32,680
Stronger?

288
00:17:33,300 --> 00:17:35,840
There isn't any shame in being weak, girl.

289
00:17:37,760 --> 00:17:39,840
The shame is in staying weak.

290
00:17:39,840 --> 00:17:43,600
That's right.

291
00:17:44,540 --> 00:17:47,220
