292
00:17:50,220 --> 00:17:51,540
He can do it.

293
00:17:52,000 --> 00:17:52,980
And so can I!

294
00:17:57,300 --> 00:17:59,120
We can grow stronger!

295
00:17:59,120 --> 00:18:05,340
